        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1 data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"717\">🔮 THE GREAT WORK — TIKKUN SYSTEM (CANON)</h1><blockquote data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"800\"><p data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"800\">“You are not fixing the world.<br data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"754\" />You are remembering how it was meant to be.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"805\" /><h2 data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"845\">📘 1. WHAT TIKKUN IS (MECHANICALLY)</h2><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"1408\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"892\"><tr data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"892\"><th data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"854\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Term</th><th data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"873\" data-col-size=\"md\">Canon Definition</th><th data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"892\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mal Translation</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1408\"><tr data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1033\"><td data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"946\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Spark</td><td data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"1007\" data-col-size=\"md\">A fragment of metaphysical alignment embedded in world/hex</td><td data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1033\" data-col-size=\"sm\">“A shard of the Tree.”</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1109\"><td data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1052\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrupted Spark</td><td data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1084\" data-col-size=\"md\">Spark under Darkness pressure</td><td data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1109\" data-col-size=\"sm\">“A shard misaligned.”</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1186\"><td data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1127\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purified Spark</td><td data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1163\" data-col-size=\"md\">Spark restored via ritual victory</td><td data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1186\" data-col-size=\"sm\">“Pattern restored.”</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1272\"><td data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1202\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tikkun Phase</td><td data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1248\" data-col-size=\"md\">Structured progress state of the Great Work</td><td data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1272\" data-col-size=\"sm\">“The ladder upward.”</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1408\"><td data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1293\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Great Work Ritual</td><td data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1381\" data-col-size=\"md\">Tier 4 strategic triggering Phase C progression <span class=\"relative inline-flex items-center\">bbttcc_activities_v1_4</span></td><td data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1408\" data-col-size=\"sm\">“The engine of ascent.”</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><hr data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1413\" /><h2 data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1456\">📊 2. TIKKUN PHASES (LIVE DESIGN LOCK)</h2><h3 data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1483\">Phase A — Recognition</h3><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1650\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1508\"><tr data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1508\"><th data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1495\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Trigger</th><th data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1508\" data-col-size=\"md\">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1650\"><tr data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1582\"><td data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1551\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Discover Spark</td><td data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1582\" data-col-size=\"md\">Exploration / Campaign Beat</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1650\"><td data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1605\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identify Corruption</td><td data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1650\" data-col-size=\"md\">Infiltration, Courtly intel, Ritual probe</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1691\">No world mutation yet. Awareness stage.</p><hr data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1696\" /><h3 data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1722\">Phase B — Engagement</h3><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1987\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1745\"><tr data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1745\"><th data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1733\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Method</th><th data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1745\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mechanic</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1987\"><tr data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1813\"><td data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1782\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ritual Raid</td><td data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1813\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Faith-weighted opposed roll</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1898\"><td data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1831\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Crown of Mercy</td><td data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1898\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Direct Spark purification <span class=\"relative inline-flex items-center\">bbttcc-agent-api</span></td></tr><tr data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1987\"><td data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1925\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Sephirotic Intervention</td><td data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1987\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Auto-win ritual roll <span class=\"relative inline-flex items-center\">bbttcc-agent-api</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"1997\">Outcome:</p><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2152\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2018\"><tr data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2018\"><th data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2008\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Result</th><th data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2018\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2152\"><tr data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2064\"><td data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2046\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fail</td><td data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2064\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Darkness spike</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2093\"><td data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2075\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Success</td><td data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2093\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Spark purified</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2152\"><td data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2110\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Great Success</td><td data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2152\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Additional Unity + alignment resonance</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><hr data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2157\" /><h3 data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2204\">Phase C — Integration (Great Work Ritual)</h3><p data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2278\">Strategic: <strong data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2238\">Great Work Ritual</strong> <span class=\"relative inline-flex items-center\">bbttcc_activities_v1_4</span></p><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2379\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2311\"><tr data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2311\"><th data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2287\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cost</th><th data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2311\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Faith 10 + Culture 5</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2379\"><tr data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2379\"><td data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2353\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effect</td><td data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2379\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Trigger Tikkun Phase C</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2389\">Phase C:</p><ul data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2535\"><li data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2432\"><p data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2432\">Spark integrated into faction identity.</p></li><li data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2463\"><p data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2463\">Alignment resonance spreads.</p></li><li data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2498\"><p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2498\">Hex may gain permanent modifier.</p></li><li data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2535\"><p data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2535\">Darkness regen reduced regionally.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2540\" /><h2 data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2574\">🌳 3. SPARK + HEX INTERACTION</h2><p data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2610\">When a Spark is purified in a hex:</p><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2775\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2631\"><tr data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2631\"><th data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2621\" data-col-size=\"sm\">System</th><th data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2631\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2775\"><tr data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2682\"><td data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2669\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Leyline Purity</td><td data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2682\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Increases</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2711\"><td data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2696\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flow State</td><td data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">More stable</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2752\"><td data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2727\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Resource Mix</td><td data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2752\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Skews toward Sephirot</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2775\"><td data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2764\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Darkness</td><td data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2775\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reduced</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2848\">Leyline + gate system integration <span class=\"relative inline-flex items-center\">main</span></p><hr data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2853\" /><h2 data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2876\">🌑 4. FAILURE PATH</h2><p data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"2894\">If Ritual fails:</p><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"3108\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2920\"><tr data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2920\"><th data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2905\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effect</th><th data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2920\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Consequence</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"3108\"><tr data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2987\"><td data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2965\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Darkness +1 or +2</td><td data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"2987\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corruption spreads</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3068\"><td data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3006\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ego-Dragon Echo</td><td data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3068\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Risk multiplier ×2 <span class=\"relative inline-flex items-center\">bbttcc-agent-api</span></td></tr><tr data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3108\"><td data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3086\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Drift pressure</td><td data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3108\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Political fracture</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3151\">Tikkun is high reward, high entropy risk.</p>"
